  (text "Smart vent backpack for Seeed XIAO ESP32-C6 (generated by generate.py)" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ad29ca20-23c4-4a29-8f3f-6b744e0a3135))
  (text "Q1 blocks a reversed cell. Servo power: TPS22917 cuts the cell off completely (nA leakage), MT3608 boosts to 5.1 V." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 139b5f1d-530f-4bd4-84ea-0dd31da3078d))
  (text "Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 51k/6.8k) = 5.1 V.  D3 (SRV_EN) also feeds the limit switch through R9." (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6fa6164a-37a0-4c3c-8ccf-7281c2f350a4))
  (text "Wire TP1/TP2 to the XIAO's BAT+/BAT- pads through the board's window." (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4dbb7f8c-7779-4d01-84ef-81e783ee8b6f))
